flowchart TD

    A([Start])

    A --> B[Print 'Serving /romconfig page']
    B --> C[Create HTML Header and CSS]
    C --> D[Add Page Title and Back Link]

    D --> E[Build ROM Assignment Table]

    E --> F{{Loop Through 14 Sensor Positions}}

    F --> G[Read Current ROM Assignment]
    G --> H[Create Table Row]
    H --> I[Populate ROM Dropdown]
    I --> J[Create Set Button]
    J --> K{More Sensors?}

    K -->|Yes| F
    K -->|No| L

    L[Create Side-by-Side Layout]

    L --> M[Build Graph Y-Axis Settings Form]
    M --> N[Build Operator Variables Form]

    N --> O[Build Sender Credentials Form]
    O --> P[Build HTTP POST URL Form]

    P --> Q[Build Recipient Email Form]

    Q --> R{{Loop Through 6 Recipient Fields}}

    R --> S[Add Recipient Input]
    S --> T{More Recipients?}

    T -->|Yes| R
    T -->|No| U

    U[Generate JavaScript]

    U --> V[Graph Change Detection]
    V --> W[Operator Change Detection]
    W --> X[HTTP URL Change Detection]
    X --> Y[Sender Credential Change Detection]
    Y --> Z[Recipient Change Detection]

    Z --> AA[Register Submit Event Handlers]

    AA --> AB[Initialize Form State]

    AB --> AC[Generate ROM JavaScript]

    AC --> AD[ROM Change Detection]
    AD --> AE[Highlight Changed Set Button]
    AE --> AF[Reset Button After Submit]

    AF --> AG[Close HTML Document]

    AG --> AH[server.send HTML Page]

    AH --> AI([End])
